cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Fungal BGC Atlas: a curated, evidence-linked knowledge base of 609 literature- and MIBiG-derived fungal biosynthetic gene cluster dossiers"
abstract: >-
  A curated, evidence-linked knowledge base of 609 fungal biosynthetic gene
  cluster (BGC) dossiers, each anchored to a MIBiG accession. Every dossier
  resolves into genes, metabolites, experiments, measurements, claims and
  curated subject-predicate-object relationships, all traceable to source
  records through explicit evidence links, with disagreements and unresolved
  normalization preserved as first-class records. Packaged as a relational
  SQLite database, a knowledge graph, and a self-contained interactive web
  dashboard.
type: software
